<title>FINLAND: Metra 1996 profit, net sales by division.</title>
<headline>Metra 1996 profit, net sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish diversified engineering group Metra Oy Ab on Wednesday gave the following breakdown of its 1996 results (million markka unless stated):</p>
<p>   Operating profit:  1996    1995 Net sales: 1996   1995</p>
<p>Wartsila Diesel	  320     385  (FIM bln)    8    6.9</p>
<p>Sanitec		    352     325  (FIM bln)  2.7    2.5</p>
<p>Imatra Steel	     102     173		 925    994</p>
<p>Other operations	 308     117		 n/a    n/a</p>
<p>Group		    1,082   1,000	    11,660 10,617</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
